# Force LF line endings regardless of platform/git config. Several tests
# embed multi-line Go source fixtures as raw string literals and assert on
# exact newline-delimited content (see internal/annotations/writer_test.go,
# pkg/analyzer/*_test.go's writeProject/writeSource helpers); GitHub's
# windows-latest runners default to core.autocrlf=true, which would silently
# rewrite those literals' embedded newlines to CRLF on checkout and break
# every such assertion - not a real Windows incompatibility, just line-ending
# churn from git itself.
* text=auto eol=lf
